Package: libnetsim
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: underwater acoustic network simulator (libraries)
 NETSIM simulates underwater acoustic networks: it carries the audio of
 simulated acoustic modems through an acoustic propagation model, such as
 Bellhop from the Acoustics Toolbox, so the modems' software can be tested
 together without water.
 .
 This package contains the shared libraries.

Package: libnetsim-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libnetsim (= ${binary:Version}),
         libgoby3-dev,
         libgoby3-moos-dev,
         libgoby3-gui-dev,
         libjack-jackd2-dev,
         libboost-serialization-dev,
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: goby3-interfaces,
            jackd2
Description: underwater acoustic network simulator (development files)
 NETSIM simulates underwater acoustic networks: it carries the audio of
 simulated acoustic modems through an acoustic propagation model, such as
 Bellhop from the Acoustics Toolbox, so the modems' software can be tested
 together without water.
 .
 This package contains the headers and the CMake package
 (find_package(netsim)).

Package: netsim-apps
Architecture: any
Depends: libnetsim (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: underwater acoustic network simulator (applications)
 NETSIM simulates underwater acoustic networks: it carries the audio of
 simulated acoustic modems through an acoustic propagation model, such as
 Bellhop from the Acoustics Toolbox, so the modems' software can be tested
 together without water.
 .
 This package contains netsim_core, netsim_udp, netsim_manager,
 netsim_tool, netsim_postprocess and iBellhop.

