Package: netsim-interfaces
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: underwater acoustic network simulator (interface files)
 NETSIM simulates underwater acoustic networks: it carries the audio of
 simulated acoustic modems through an acoustic propagation model, such as
 Bellhop from the Acoustics Toolbox, so the modems' software can be tested
 together without water.
 .
 This package contains the Goby publish/subscribe interface files (YAML)
